</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>omelette</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>ominous</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>omission</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><div>omit</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>omnipresent</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>omniscient</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>omnisexual</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div>(Anatomia e antigo) o mesmo que escápula<ol><li><div>scapula</div></li><li><div>shoulder blade</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>Oman</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>oncogenesis</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>oncologist</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>wave</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div><ol><li>(Relativo) o lugar em que; o lugar no qual</li><li>(Interrogativo) em que lugar?</li></ol><div>where</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>billowy</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li><div>wave</div></li><li><div>undulate</div></li><li><div>ripple</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><ol><li><div>ripple</div></li><li><div>undulation</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>onerous</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>omnipresence</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><di